# `scripts/e2e-smoke-test.ts` is an operator-driven harness that lives
# outside `src/` (so it is excluded from the production build's tsconfig
# include list). Linting it would require a separate tsconfig just for
# scripts/; we ignore it here instead.
scripts/
# `tests/` is the Jest test root and is also outside `src/**/*` in the
# build tsconfig. Test files are already type-checked by `ts-jest` at
# test time; linting them would require a second tsconfig. Ignore.
tests/
